silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_10_alternatives_dual_computational_sections_01_alternative_formalizations_concrete_anchor_6_FeliscatusTSN183798#felis_catus_tsn_183798 silm:hasLongDescription "The Felis_catus_TSN_183798 is the taxonomy source-leg row (NOT identified with Mittens); supports refinement of DomesticCat. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Felis_catus_TSN_183798', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
